ied, but they get separated when the young man gets called for the military service and they lose contact. When the young girl marries an old military officer, the young man coincidentally gets assigned to work with her husband. Despite all the obstacles the two lovers have gone through, they decide to catch up with their past love. But when the old officer finds out what's going on between his wife and the young soldier, he decides to dramatically end their love relation.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYBEFvJjjfsKvNmQJrhc8jU5kjp.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/58OZiJkaMZPmDoK5ayzHhS9yB5W.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1951","release_date":"1951-03-23","runtime_minutes":110,"status":"Released","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["رومنسية","دراما"],"genre_keys":["romance","drama"],"similar":["mv194","mv271954","mv603661","mv859","mv9390","mv445651","mv330493","mv25196"],"director":"عمر جميعي","cast":[{"name":"فاتن حمامة","character":"فكرية","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7eYnaN8R2LcI6sOofYE5RPU5UTh.jpg"},{"name":"عماد حمدي","character":"رشاد أفندي","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9s5AtkshCQReedy7EXg11C8xdyF.jpg"},{"name":"عباس فارس","character":"صبحي","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fDcUskgOYHbKMCslBDi5U6tkOkh.jpg"},{"name":"فريد شوقي","character":"سليمان أفندي","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eGQniixtU1hjF2Fa5rYWlvt3nLk.jpg"},{"name":"عمر الحريري","character":"شوكت","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2UjTbJxOgc96wpO8zTzCgSu1Puf.jpg"},{"name":"زينب صدقي","character":"أم رشاد أفندي","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zg7OL92fPHBmko4F4YtdjT4svM7.jpg"},{"name":"ثريا فخري","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pseBRgxQirXtWPuHKao71909f7I.jpg"},{"name":"سناء سميح","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tcVAqA0vSMx